OL,3,ASeven injured, four critically, after
OL,4,ABangkok oil refinery explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been injured - four
OL,7,Fof them critically - after an explosion
OL,8,Fat an oil refinery in Bangkok, local
OL,9,Fgovernment officials have said.
OL,11,FA fire broke out after the blast at the
OL,12,FPhra Khanong facility run by energy
OL,13,Fgiant Bangchak Corporation in the east
OL,14,Fof Thailand's capital at around 14:45
OL,15,F(07:45 GMT).
OL,17,FThe company said the fire was brought
OL,18,Funder control and put out within 30
OL,19,Fminutes, adding that the cause of the
OL,20,Fincident was being investigated.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
