OL,3,ASeven injured, four critically, after
OL,4,ABangkok oil refinery explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlack smoke could be seen across
OL,7,FBangkok's skyline after the blast,
OL,8,Fwhile officials told residents to leave
OL,9,Fthe area.
